# Environment variables for the MTG deck tooling.
#
# This workspace currently needs NO secrets: the Scryfall API and its bulk-data
# exports are public and unauthenticated. This file exists to satisfy the studio
# secrets convention and to document where future variables would go.
#
# Example (uncomment and set if a future integration requires it):
# SCRYFALL_USER_AGENT="mtg-decks/0.1 (contact@example.com)"
